								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">that&#039;s not what i mean. i mean if you only voted on one issue (the &quot;dumbasses&quot; i had in mind were the ones that saw abortion or gay marriage as the deciding factor).<br /><br />i&#039;m afraid when it comes time for me to vote i&#039;ll probably be going mostly democrat but i&#039;d probably hit up the libertarian party in more local elections if i felt they had any chance of winning. their stance against social services kinda alarms me, though. gonna have to be dems for the presidential/most senatorial spots even if libs have a chance to win, though.<br /><br />but seriously fuck representative government! i want to vote on federal issues every day, not every 2 years!<br /><br />by the way i think anyone should be able to get married but i&#039;m pro-life.</div>
