							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">damn, that is really sad. i really just don&#039;t feel that once everything has been set in motion, that it&#039;s right to derail the train. i say this selfishly, though, as i would never have a life growing inside me and then perhaps have to give it to somebody else. it&#039;s tough. i really just feel that abortion should be illegal except when another life (such as the mother&#039;s) would be threatened by the birth.<br /><br />thanks for posting that, though. that was deep.</div>
